<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-πειράομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>try</i> or <i>attempt again:</i> generally,
				<i>make a trial, essay,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς σκάφεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					25.4.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπειρᾶσθαι ναῦν</span>
			<i>make trial of</i> a new ship, <i>prove</i> her, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				51.5
			</span></i>; also of the ship herself, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντες
				ἑωρᾶθ᾽ ὑμεῖς ἀναπειρωμένην τὴν ναῦν</span> ibid.;
			esp. as a naval term, <i>manœuvre, exercise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.7
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>.</div>
